I. rtsp.py : read rtsp and count FPS

  1.change rtsp url
 
  2.execute python3 rtsp.py

--------------------------------------------
II. rtsp_getpic.py : read rtsp and save 1 img per second

  1.create img_save folder

  2. change rtsp url

  3.execute python3 rtsp_getpic.py

--------------------------------------------
III. rtsp_recordavi.py : read rtsp and save to avi

  1.change rtsp url

  2.execute python3 rtsp_recordavi.py

--------------------------------------------
IV. yolov8_CPU_mult_thread.py : using CPU multhreading mode to run YOLOv8

  1.change rtsp url and pt model

  2.execute python3 yolov8_CPU_mult_thread.py


